# On-screen controls on the platform's own layout (MEADOW_START=level): one thumb holds the d-pad right while the
# other holds A to jump. Touches go through the same hit testing as fingers (InputScript "touch"); used by the phone
# checks, which need both held together for a while (scripted runs on a device step faster than real time).
120 capture touch_start.png
130 touch 1 dpad 0.8 0
170 touch 2 jump
190 capture touch_jump.png
230 lift 2
260 lift 1
280 capture touch_end.png
300 quit
